     "id": "0bd61de4",
     "elType": "widget",
     "widgetType": "text-editor",
     "settings": {
      "editor": "<p style=\"margin:0;max-width:615px;\">We planned everything to a tee but also left room for those candid moments and shots every photographer strives for. When D-Day came, we had everything ready to go – we even had the help of a furry friend. Things went so smoothly, and Sky Gazer had so much confidence they were happy to let us run the show whilst they continued to work. We captured enough content to last them for months. We’re talking collateral that could be used across their website, socials, ads and all sorts of marketing material. We pulled this off with:</p>",
